{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"af3d977a9984d07d","name":"card_unit_coastal_battalion_7","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Finland/units/card_unit_coastal_battalion_7","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"COASTAL BATTALION 7","text":"Units you deploy get +1+1 for each combat keyword they have.","flavorText":"The 7th Coastal Infantry Battalion is best known for being involved in the Battle of Suursaari, recapturing Gogland Island in the Gulf of Finland in the spring of 1944. The island held high strategic value due to its location between Finland, the Soviet Union and Estonia. Though previously abandoned, the Soviets had reoccupied and fortified it with over 1,000 troops. The 7th Coastal Infantry Battalion, led by Captain Esko Laaksonen, played a central role in the assault, landing under fire and pushing inland in close-quarter combat. The battalion had to overcome difficult terrain and strong resistance to secure key positions on the island. The operation concluded after seven days of fighting, with Finnish forces regaining control of Gogland, defending it for the rest of the Continuation War.","faction":"Finland","type":"infantry","rarity":"Rare","cost":4,"operationCost":1,"attack":3,"defense":5},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_coastal_battalion_7","title":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_unit_coastal_battalion_7_title","SourceString":"COASTAL BATTALION 7","LocalizedString":"COASTAL BATTALION 7"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":3,"defense":5,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Finland","kredits":4,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_unit_coastal_battalion_7_text","SourceString":"Units you deploy get +1+1 for each combat keyword they have.","LocalizedString":"Units you deploy get +1+1 for each combat keyword they have."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_finland","Key":"card_unit_coastal_battalion_7_history","SourceString":"The 7th Coastal Infantry Battalion is best known for being involved in the Battle of Suursaari, recapturing Gogland Island in the Gulf of Finland in the spring of 1944. The island held high strategic value due to its location between Finland, the Soviet Union and Estonia. Though previously abandoned, the Soviets had reoccupied and fortified it with over 1,000 troops. The 7th Coastal Infantry Battalion, led by Captain Esko Laaksonen, played a central role in the assault, landing under fire and pushing inland in close-quarter combat. The battalion had to overcome difficult terrain and strong resistance to secure key positions on the island. The operation concluded after seven days of fighting, with Finnish forces regaining control of Gogland, defending it for the rest of the Continuation War.","LocalizedString":"The 7th Coastal Infantry Battalion is best known for being involved in the Battle of Suursaari, recapturing Gogland Island in the Gulf of Finland in the spring of 1944. The island held high strategic value due to its location between Finland, the Soviet Union and Estonia. Though previously abandoned, the Soviets had reoccupied and fortified it with over 1,000 troops. The 7th Coastal Infantry Battalion, led by Captain Esko Laaksonen, played a central role in the assault, landing under fire and pushing inland in close-quarter combat. The battalion had to overcome difficult terrain and strong resistance to secure key positions on the island. The operation concluded after seven days of fighting, with Finnish forces regaining control of Gogland, defending it for the rest of the Continuation War."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Rare","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Homefront","EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardPlayedFromHand"],"hasBlitz":true,"hasAmbush":true,"historyPhoto":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/HistoricalPhotos/COASTAL_BATTALION_7.COASTAL_BATTALION_7","SubPathString":""},"historyPhotoSize":{"X":512.0,"Y":314.0},"historyPhotoDescription":{"Namespace":"card_fi